  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-preset-switch",
      "text": "Switch DeepSeek Harness agent presets in a running session."
    },
    {
      "section": "Screenshots",
      "text": "Slash-menu popup picker:\n\nHeader dropdown:"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- `/preset <id>` command to switch the agent preset live.\n- **Web popup picker**: in the browser slash-menu, picking `/preset` opens a searchable second-level menu; select a preset instead of typing it.\n- `/preset <number>` also works as a keyboard fallback (e.g. `/preset 2`).\n- `/preset-toggle [on|off]` to enable/disable the feature.\n- HTTP endpoint for UI integration.\n- Allows deliberate mid-session switching; the official blank-session lock is bypassed and a warning is shown because old tool calls may not match the new preset."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:aorucshiea/dsh-preset-switch\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage",
      "text": "```text\n/preset                       show current preset and numbered menu\n/preset <id>                  switch preset on a blank session\n/preset <number>              same as /preset <id>, picked by menu number\n/preset-toggle on|off         enable / disable the command"
    },
    {
      "section": "Notes",
      "text": "- No API keys or credentials are stored in this repository."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
